Bm4/ (14 modules) is copied from `lean/Bm4/` of koteitan/bms-elem-pattern
(https://github.com/koteitan/bms-elem-pattern, CC BY-SA 4.0), revision
201f695c48021c2e2e4776292ed228859d8ef317, which takes it from
koteitan/dh-bms-wf-formal (https://github.com/koteitan/dh-bms-wf-formal), a
formalization of DH's proof of the well-foundedness of BM4.  It is ported
from Lean 4.30.0 to Lean 4.33.1.  The only change of a proof is in
`Bm4/Copy.lean` (`col_pos`).  Each file starts with a header saying so.

Por/ is adapted from `Por/` of koteitan/1y-wo-por
(https://github.com/koteitan/1y-wo-por), whose helpers in turn come from
`lean/Pattern/` of koteitan/bms-elem-pattern.  The root index of the 1-Y
version is removed, and the model is stated against the label interface
`BM4.LabelSystem` of Bm4/.  Each file names its sources in its header.

No code from Phyrion's 1Y-Well-Ordering-Lean, YesMetaZFC,
BMS-Well-Ordering-Lean or any other project without a license is copied or
adapted here.
